      "actionTag": "smtpstream",
      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Dana Osei:</b> I had a capture running the whole time you were talking to that server. Before we move on, I want you to see what an SMTP conversation looks like to anybody else sitting on this segment: a contractor's laptop, a compromised workstation, the historian itself.",
      "taskInstructions": "Open Wireshark and inspect the SMTP conversation for plaintext commands and replies.",
      "taskQuestion": "Open the SMTP capture in Wireshark.",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Dana Osei:</b> The capture exposes the SMTP commands, recipient address, and reply codes because STARTTLS was not negotiated."
